{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4da4dfb6d890e2ff2ecc4433d157a4f8d7fb9a117b702a2baadfb167ab0034b8", "ja": "（明日は劇場の公演当日。\nエレナは、久しぶりの公演出演だ）", "zh": "（明天就是剧场公演的日子。\n艾莲娜也要参加久违的公演了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "77cd1875d688f1929fb317237df08ffb37d43d44ece67488fbe6c38c01b4839a", "ja": "{$P$}、遅くまでゴメンネ？\nでも、コレでバッチリだヨ～♪", "zh": "{$P$}，这么晚还麻烦你，真不好意思哦？\n不过，这样就万无一失啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e85afcfbde1cfb6c1e35f4be0e00f8a44bbaaf926691a27131a5b82ccd88b274", "ja": "そうか、良かった。けど、すっかり\n遅くなっちゃったな。それじゃ……。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。不过，已经不知不觉这么晚了。那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "7abf0f9ff4a699b8d54d7517fc01a1d87e38abe5ea17865ada3e1c1e8e328dd4", "ja": "エヘヘ……♪　{$P$}に\n送ってもらえて、うれしいナ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪ 能让{$P$}送我回来，我好开心呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a4b4db32a0ff23d2011ca38c92bb080ac4692e92273eb71271f0c12b354adce6", "ja": "俺はエレナのプロデューサーだからな。\nこれくらい、普通のことだよ。", "zh": "因为我是艾丽娜的制作人嘛。\n这点小事很正常。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "bfa27da3524f048f9cfbd155598dc07662d71952a3d590176fda5737c169456e", "ja": "エヘヘッ、ありがとー♪　{$P$}、\n明日はいよいよ本番だネ？　早く明日にならないかナ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你♪ {$P$}，明天终于要正式演出了吧？真希望明天快点到来呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "4c6edd86b678a72a039bdc919e743372dc9ed5ebccb3bd58f5740089cd2e53c9", "ja": "ワタシ、今から本番でもいいくらいだヨ！\n今すぐお日様が顔を出してくれないかナ～。", "zh": "我啊，现在就算直接上台演出也没问题哦！\n太阳能不能现在马上露露脸呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1007_p", "source_sha256": "15a6189840432a2452dc2773782295e92d8349e66cd2a14123560db53c015ae4", "ja": "はは、それはさすがに無理じゃないかな。\nそれに、ちゃんと体を休めてからでないと。", "zh": "哈哈，那也未免太勉强了吧。\n而且，还是先好好休息一下再说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "c9518572d841109d20cdc21ca7d41dbd15f1c8c76917dc2e8c503176285565e4", "ja": "あ！　{$P$}、見て見て！\nお日様は出てないケド、お星様がたくさん出てるヨ。", "zh": "啊！{$P$}，快看快看！\n虽然太阳没有出来，但星星出来了好多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "92e41545ae0ba7c3db8debe14e253172fd07b1ad585275b67da87b67b08011cd", "ja": "空がキラキラしてる……すごくキレイだネー。", "zh": "天空闪闪发光……真的好漂亮呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1010_p", "source_sha256": "47f4ab212d69e62e2f0bb1d57ebf6cc5ed82cb55b828e48d32f59e93e343fb3d", "ja": "ああ、本当だ。\nこの辺りは明かりも少ないから、よく見えるのかな。", "zh": "啊，真的。\n这一带灯光也比较少，所以才能看得这么清楚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "64c8f723f8e11a7aa181cc79ab41b81a96299eba01ee2db1e3de7dadac665658", "ja": "{$P$}、知ってる？\n日本とブラジルだと、お星様が違うんだって！", "zh": "{$P$}，你知道吗？\n听说日本和巴西看到的星星是不一样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1012_p", "source_sha256": "562f4030ba0e1d76ea736ffdbf57e51cf449f83d439d16e07ac9d1e6e0ba75b9", "ja": "日本とブラジル？　……そうか、\nエレナは子どもの頃、ブラジルにいたんだっけ。", "zh": "日本和巴西？……这样啊，\n艾蕾娜小时候是在巴西来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "b4e5cc370223ad223edc17242d743d2ffda432616e843d12c4f197266974ab7b", "ja": "ウン！　ママンに教えてもらったノ。その時は、\nどういう意味か、よくわからなかったケド……。", "zh": "嗯！这是妈妈教我的。当时还不太明白是什么意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "05ffb05379fabf48713a94fc16ec3bbae0bf70f24ee7c62dc674a074f19e4eeb", "ja": "日本とブラジルは、同じ季節でも見える星が違うから、\n星座とかもゼンゼン違うってコトだったみたい！", "zh": "原来是因为日本和巴西即使在同一个季节，能看到的星星也不一样，所以星座之类的也完全不同！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9b7214d47b0aa4cfb47239533c88fccb0a3177240cfb417ed9d01ba34f226e27", "ja": "ブラジルは南半球だから、見える空の範囲が\nそもそも違うんだったな。", "zh": "巴西位于南半球，所以能看到的天空范围本来就不一样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "70031803b4357f255a7c8bc73fdf54953fb23926521b3e89484d44e1b7b5125f", "ja": "そう！　{$P$}、さすがだネ♪\nでもワタシには、どのお星様も同じに見えちゃうヨー。", "zh": "没错！{$P$}，不愧是你♪  \n不过在我看来，每颗星星都长得一样哦——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c415abc7b687a6021cd4a0a3eba07b72716cc8f1a98e042cf9b126acea511d0f", "ja": "はは、ひとつひとつは同じにしか見えないって。\nエレナはブラジルの事、他にも覚えてるのか？", "zh": "哈哈，单独看每一颗确实都一样嘛。\n艾莉娜还记得其他关于巴西的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "ff7ab3ed6bac9b40e9deb6cd038697abc5c322d10dc7adc5adb4ed86ab32d750", "ja": "ウーン……すこしだけ！　友達と遊んだこととかネ。\nあのころの友達、みんな元気カナ……。", "zh": "嗯……只记得一点点！比如和朋友一起玩之类的。\n不知道那时候的朋友们，大家都还好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "53936add19cb6527fa83995c619bbf08d68293f7d2c264dac8b10c3dd2afde47", "ja": "ちょっと、昔のコト思い出しちゃった。\nワタシ、小さいころに日本に来たでショ？", "zh": "一不小心想起了一些以前的事。  \n我小时候来日本的时候，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "01848c0eae3433ad0ec04c91abfefef002c7bb7dc34dec5055bd63c391acaf58", "ja": "最初、こっちの言葉がよくわからなかったから、\nなかなか友達ができなかったノ。", "zh": "刚来的时候，这边的话听不太懂，\n所以一直交不到朋友呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "7324af92184b8183dc121062fa5a33b100b4f876aa1423f51ce82c3967e1e856", "ja": "だから、ずっとひとりで遊んでたヨ。\nひとりぼっちは、寂しかったナ……。", "zh": "所以，我一直都是一个人玩。\n孤零零的，真的很寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "01e78618f0a5db4838e8d93f5630fdcf4cee3c699437fc774eaf53bd93952150", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\n今も、寂しくなったりするのか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n现在也会感到寂寞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "74ea0d1ba070b2f944800708847bf16d33691e54c8dafa2d1a887eeb0b2cc24e", "ja": "ウウン！　今は言葉もちゃんとわかるし、\n学校にいっぱい友達ができたから、大丈夫だヨ！", "zh": "不是的！现在我已经能听懂大家说的话了，\n而且在学校也交到了很多朋友，所以没关系啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "da1be150f41313ebff66d6c5ae1f0584d61f6ff0e371e651cfca217022b95e2a", "ja": "それに……劇場のみんなも、{$P$}も\nいるしネ♪　毎日、とっても楽しいヨー！", "zh": "而且……剧场的大家，还有{$P$}也在嘛♪每天都特别开心哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1025_p", "source_sha256": "170961092cf3d65bb5910735f0c3c74ef9ee70f7d656a00de8499d5ad8878096", "ja": "エレナ……。", "zh": "艾琳娜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_1026", "source_sha256": "5a27768cf85ee574e4799a99b07512c01cf39a210a6921a323bb19c3cad2c21d", "ja": "えらかったな", "zh": "你做得很棒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_2000_p", "source_sha256": "05f66ae249fc197a416966d1326fae41159cce78ea463610b28fac250151b5b6", "ja": "えらかったな、エレナ。", "zh": "真了不起啊，艾丽娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_2001_018ele", "source_sha256": "17f1de30ce6b6b7e32af106703c6385333afcc177358843879cea5d6466baaa2", "ja": "？　えらかった……そうかナ？", "zh": "？很了不起……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_2002_p", "source_sha256": "78112e50e56519b9697cc766f4db1db0bbcb93d4d560418fe5ef5860f57633c7", "ja": "ああ。寂しさや言葉の壁に負けないで、\n友達をたくさん作ることができたんだからな。", "zh": "是啊。因为你没有被寂寞和语言的障碍打败，还交到了很多朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_2003_p", "source_sha256": "5695ef60992cb0d4ea80e86b6a571f2226d865d88900408ce3bb48092eb9047a", "ja": "小さいころから、エレナは頑張り屋だったんだ。\nだからアイドルも、頑張れるんだと思う。", "zh": "从小时候起，艾莲娜就是个努力的孩子。\n所以我想，偶像的工作你也一定能全力以赴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_2005_018ele", "source_sha256": "7c9319d56e6f4f3857c20a2561cb760386cb55f609e401973fd82d9ad0e4ceb2", "ja": "エヘヘ♪\nワタシ、アイドルになってよかったって思うヨ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪\n我觉得，自己能成为偶像真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_2006_018ele", "source_sha256": "bf80220256005c3658d259d3f59ef18b187fad4831476bb23bb164ef5170804e", "ja": "今まで知らなかったコト、たくさん覚えたし……\n新しい友達も、いっぱいできたから♪", "zh": "我还学会了许多以前不知道的东西……\n也交到了好多新朋友♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_2007_018ele", "source_sha256": "8fd7012b41550638549685c711ce58e0735a5a935ae2bdd5f8733735abd90783", "ja": "{$P$}、\nワタシをスカウトしてくれて、ホントにありがとネ！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你来发掘我，让我成为偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_005_2008_p", "source_sha256": "31740f85012dc8030bedf75ec8859e989cb0460dc78400e9fb04d9f591e3cd8b", "ja": "こっちこそ、アイドルになってくれてありがとう。\nエレナ、これからもよろしくな！", "zh": "我才要谢谢你愿意成为偶像。\n艾蕾娜，以后也请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
